--- BP-Free Jumps
-- Blaster Defense (2)
-- 25% more special damage
-- Saber Deflect (2)
> Reborn Lightsaber (Cyan)
-- 8% more damage
-- EX Saber Throw (3) ^3[CS1]
--- 23% more damage
> Scepter of Ragnos (Yellow)
-- 8% more damage
-- 50% longer
-- 10% less AS
-- 33% thinner
> Sith Sword (Cyan)
-- 8% more damage
-- 10% more AS
-- 5% faster movement
-- 8% shorter
-- EX Saber Throw (3) ^3[CS1]
--- 23% more damage

^5Force Powers:
- Push (2)
- Pull (2)
- Sense (1)
- Lightning (1) ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
